# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MARITIME AI ESTIMATOR: Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your real keys.
# .env.local is gitignored, it will NEVER be committed to GitHub.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── REQUIRED ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Google Gemini API Key: used to access the AI model (free tier)
#
# How to get it:
# 1. Go to https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# 2. Sign in with any Google account
# 3. Click "Create API key"
# 4. Copy it here
#
# Why this works: Gemini's free tier needs no credit card and has generous
# daily limits, plenty for demos. The code uses Google's own AI SDK provider
# (@ai-sdk/google), not the OpenAI-compatible shim - that shim has a bug where
# it drops a field Gemini needs for streaming tool calls.
#
# (This used to run on GitHub Models, but GitHub fully retired that service
# on July 30, 2026 - it no longer works for anyone, on any plan.)
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_key_here

# ── OPTIONAL ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# WeatherAPI.com API Key: for LIVE marine weather data
#
# Without this key, the app uses realistic Baltic Sea average values (still works fine).
# For the pitch demo, real data is impressive but not required.
#
# How to get it (free):
# 1. Go to https://www.weatherapi.com/
# 2. Sign up for a free account (no credit card needed)
# 3. Copy your API key from the dashboard
WEATHER_API_KEY=your_weatherapi_key_here
